  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short term technical assistance and capacity building services to Caribbean governments to strengthen macroeconomic policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the IMF&#x2019;s Caribbean Regional Technical Assistance Centre that provides demand based, short term TA and capacity building services to governments in the region to strengthen macroeconomic policy making, public financial management (PFM), tax and customs administration, financial sector surveillance, regulation and supervision, and statistics to Belize, Dominica, Grenada, Guyana, Jamaica, Saint Lucia, and Saint Vincent and the Grenadines ( ODA-eligible Caribbean countries) and other countries in the Caribbean, through bilateral and regional projects</narrative>
  </description>
